{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ was damaged while downloading. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعرّض %@ للتلف أثناء التنزيل. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ was damaged while downloading. Try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ indirilirken bozuldu. Tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Create a free account at webostv.developer.lge.com." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. أنشئ حسابًا مجانيًا على webostv.developer.lge.com."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Create a free account at webostv.developer.lge.com."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. webostv.developer.lge.com adresinde ücretsiz bir hesap açın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the TV, open Apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. على التلفاز، افتح التطبيقات."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. On the TV, open Apps."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. TV'de Uygulamalar'ı açın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the TV, open Settings › Device Preferences › About (Google TV: Settings › System › About)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. على التلفاز، افتح الإعدادات › تفضيلات الجهاز › حول (في Google TV: الإعدادات › النظام › حول)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. On the TV, open Settings › Device Preferences › About (Google TV: Settings › System › About)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. TV'de Ayarlar › Cihaz Tercihleri › Hakkında'yı açın (Google TV'de: Ayarlar › Sistem › Hakkında)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. On the TV, install Developer Mode from the LG Content Store and sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. على التلفاز، ثبّت Developer Mode من LG Content Store وسجّل الدخول."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. On the TV, install Developer Mode from the LG Content Store and sign in."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. TV'de LG Content Store'dan Developer Mode uygulamasını kurun ve giriş yapın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. اضغط 1 2 3 4 5 على جهاز التحكم عن بُعد (أو اكتب 12345 على لوحة الأرقام في الشاشة). تُفتح نافذة وضع المطوّر."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Kumandada 1 2 3 4 5 tuşlarına basın (ya da ekran klavyesinde 12345 yazın). Geliştirici modu penceresi açılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press OK on Build 7 times until it says you are a developer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. اضغط موافق على رقم الإصدار 7 مرات حتى تظهر رسالة بأنك أصبحت مطوّرًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Press OK on Build 7 times until it says you are a developer."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Yapı numarasının üzerinde, geliştirici olduğunuz yazana kadar 7 kez Tamam'a basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Go back to Device Preferences (Google TV: System) › Developer options and turn on USB debugging. Turn on Network debugging too if you see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. ارجع إلى تفضيلات الجهاز (في Google TV: النظام) › خيارات المطوّرين وفعّل تصحيح أخطاء USB. وفعّل تصحيح الأخطاء عبر الشبكة أيضًا إن ظهر لك."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Go back to Device Preferences (Google TV: System) › Developer options and turn on USB debugging. Turn on Network debugging too if you see it."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Cihaz Tercihleri (Google TV'de Sistem) › Geliştirici seçenekleri'ne dönün ve USB hata ayıklama'yı açın. Ağ hata ayıklama da görünüyorsa onu da açın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this computer's address as Host PC IP: %@ and press OK." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. شغّل Developer mode، واكتب عنوان هذا الكمبيوتر في Host PC IP: %@ ثم اضغط OK."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this computer's address as Host PC IP: %@ and press OK."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Developer mode'u On yapın, Host PC IP alanına bu bilgisayarın adresini (%@) yazın ve OK'e basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts and this screen continues by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. شغّل Dev Mode Status. سيُعاد تشغيل التلفاز، وتنتقل هذه الشاشة إلى الخطوة التالية تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts and this screen continues by itself."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Dev Mode Status'u açın. TV yeniden başlar, bu ekran kendiliğinden devam eder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Restart the TV: hold the power button on the remote for about 2 seconds until the TV turns off, then turn it on again. This screen continues by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. أعد تشغيل التلفاز: اضغط مطولًا على زر التشغيل في جهاز التحكم عن بُعد نحو ثانيتين حتى ينطفئ التلفاز، ثم شغّله مجددًا. تنتقل هذه الشاشة إلى الخطوة التالية تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Restart the TV: hold the power button on the remote for about 2 seconds until the TV turns off, then turn it on again. This screen continues by itself."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. TV'yi yeniden başlatın: TV kapanana kadar kumandanın güç tuşunu yaklaşık 2 saniye basılı tutun, sonra yeniden açın. Bu ekran kendiliğinden devam eder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game packs, the term list and dubbing work only for Turkish. Arabic subtitles come from the translation engine you chose (Apple's free translation, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL or a local model)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حزم الألعاب وقائمة المصطلحات والدبلجة تعمل مع التركية فقط. أما الترجمة العربية فتأتي من محرك الترجمة الذي اخترته (ترجمة Apple المجانية أو Gemini أو ChatGPT أو Claude أو DeepL أو نموذج محلي)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Game packs, the term list and dubbing work only for Turkish. Arabic subtitles come from the translation engine you chose (Apple's free translation, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL or a local model)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oyun paketleri, terim listesi ve dublaj yalnız Türkçede çalışır. Arapça altyazılar seçtiğin çeviri motorundan gelir (Apple'ın ücretsiz çevirisi, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL ya da yerel model)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dubbing works only when the translation language is Turkish." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا تعمل الدبلجة إلا عندما تكون لغة الترجمة هي التركية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dubbing works only when the translation language is Turkish."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dublaj yalnız çeviri dili Türkçeyken çalışır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter account ID manually" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أدخل معرّف الحساب يدويًا"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter account ID manually"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hesap Kimliğini Elle Gir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game packs, the term list and dubbing work only for Turkish. Arabic subtitles come from the translation engine you chose (the free translation, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL or a local model)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعمل حزم الألعاب وقائمة المصطلحات والدبلجة باللغة التركية فقط. تأتي الترجمة العربية من محرك الترجمة الذي اخترته (الترجمة المجانية أو Gemini أو ChatGPT أو Claude أو DeepL أو نموذج محلي)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Game packs, the term list and dubbing work only for Turkish. Arabic subtitles come from the translation engine you chose (the free translation, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL or a local model)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oyun paketleri, terim listesi ve dublaj yalnız Türkçede çalışır. Arapça altyazılar seçtiğin çeviri motorundan gelir (ücretsiz çeviri, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL ya da yerel model)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Sony's sign-in page does not open (some internet providers block it), enter the second account's PSN account ID in base64 (12 characters, e.g. AbCdEfGhIjk=)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا لم تُفتح صفحة تسجيل الدخول من Sony (يحظرها بعض مزوّدي الإنترنت)، فأدخل معرّف حساب PSN للحساب الثاني بصيغة base64 ‏(12 حرفًا، مثل AbCdEfGhIjk=)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Sony's sign-in page does not open (some internet providers block it), enter the second account's PSN account ID in base64 (12 characters, e.g. AbCdEfGhIjk=)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sony'nin giriş sayfası açılmıyorsa (bazı internet sağlayıcıları engelliyor) ikinci hesabın PSN hesap kimliğini base64 olarak girin (12 karakter, ör. AbCdEfGhIjk=)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the TV keeps switching to HDMI 1 or another source while the Nino TV app is open, turn off Anynet+ (HDMI-CEC) and Auto Source Switching on the TV: Settings › All Settings › Connection › External Device Manager." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا ظل التلفاز ينتقل إلى HDMI 1 أو مصدر آخر أثناء فتح تطبيق Nino للتلفاز، فأوقف Anynet+ ‏(HDMI-CEC) والتبديل التلقائي للمصدر على التلفاز: الإعدادات › كل الإعدادات › الاتصال › مدير الأجهزة الخارجية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the TV keeps switching to HDMI 1 or another source while the Nino TV app is open, turn off Anynet+ (HDMI-CEC) and Auto Source Switching on the TV: Settings › All Settings › Connection › External Device Manager."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nino TV uygulaması açıkken TV sürekli HDMI 1'e ya da başka bir kaynağa geçiyorsa TV'de Ayarlar › Tüm Ayarlar › Bağlantı › Harici Cihaz Yöneticisi'nden Anynet+ (HDMI-CEC) ve Otomatik Kaynak Değiştirme'yi kapatın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Packs are not used while the translation language is Arabic." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا تُستخدم الحزم عندما تكون لغة الترجمة هي العربية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Packs are not used while the translation language is Arabic."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Çeviri dili Arapçayken paketler kullanılmaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PS5 paired: %@ (%@). Press Continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم إقران PS5: ‏%@ ‏(%@). اضغط متابعة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 paired: %@ (%@). Press Continue."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 eşleşti: %@ (%@). Devam'a basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حفظ"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kaydet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The English–Arabic language pack is not downloaded yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم تُنزَّل حزمة اللغة الإنجليزية–العربية بعد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The English–Arabic language pack is not downloaded yet."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "İngilizce–Arapça dil paketi henüz indirilmedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a valid account ID. It is 12 characters in base64, e.g. AbCdEfGhIjk=." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذا ليس معرّف حساب صالحًا. يتكوّن من 12 حرفًا بصيغة base64، مثل AbCdEfGhIjk=."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is not a valid account ID. It is 12 characters in base64, e.g. AbCdEfGhIjk=."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu geçerli bir hesap kimliği değil. Kimlik base64 biçiminde 12 karakterdir, ör. AbCdEfGhIjk=."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To restart a Samsung TV fully, hold the power button on the remote for about 2 seconds until it turns off; a short press only puts it on standby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لإعادة تشغيل تلفاز Samsung بالكامل، اضغط مطولًا على زر التشغيل في جهاز التحكم عن بُعد نحو ثانيتين حتى ينطفئ؛ فالضغطة القصيرة تضعه في وضع الاستعداد فقط."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To restart a Samsung TV fully, hold the power button on the remote for about 2 seconds until it turns off; a short press only puts it on standby."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Samsung TV'yi tamamen yeniden başlatmak için TV kapanana kadar kumandanın güç tuşunu yaklaşık 2 saniye basılı tutun. Kısa basarsanız TV yalnızca bekleme moduna geçer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8-digit code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رمز من 8 أرقام"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8-digit code"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8 haneli kod"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PS5 on the same Wi-Fi network as this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جهاز PS5 على شبكة Wi-Fi نفسها التي يتصل بها جهاز Mac هذا"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A PS5 on the same Wi-Fi network as this Mac"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu Mac ile aynı Wi-Fi ağında bir PS5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PS5 on the same network as this computer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جهاز PS5 على الشبكة نفسها التي يتصل بها هذا الكمبيوتر"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A PS5 on the same network as this computer"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bilgisayarla aynı ağda bir PS5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free second PlayStation Network account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حساب PlayStation Network ثانٍ مجاني"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A free second PlayStation Network account"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ücretsiz ikinci bir PlayStation Network hesabı"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new version of Nino is available: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يتوفر إصدار جديد من Nino: ‏%@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new version of Nino is available: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nino'nun yeni sürümü çıktı: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second PSN account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حساب PSN ثانٍ"
          }
        },
