            "value" : "Gelişmiş"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These waits only delay lines that were read badly; most lines are shown without waiting. A shorter wait shows those lines sooner but lets more wrong translations through." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فترات الانتظار هذه لا تؤخر إلا الأسطر التي قُرئت بشكل غير صحيح؛ ومعظم الأسطر تظهر دون انتظار. الانتظار الأقصر يعرض تلك الأسطر بشكل أسرع، لكنه يسمح بمرور مزيد من الترجمات الخاطئة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These waits only delay lines that were read badly; most lines are shown without waiting. A shorter wait shows those lines sooner but lets more wrong translations through."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu beklemeler yalnızca kötü okunan satırları geciktirir; çoğu satır hiç beklemeden gösterilir. Kısa bekleme bu satırları daha erken gösterir ama daha çok yanlış çeviriye yol açar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for a misread line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الانتظار عند قراءة سطر بشكل خاطئ"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wait for a misread line"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hatalı okunan satır için bekleme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a line is read with words that are not in the dictionary, a better reading is awaited for at most this long. Measured in GTA V, translations from misread lines compared with 0 s: 0.2 s → 77%, 0.4 s → 49%, 0.6 s → 41%, 0.8 s (recommended) → 34%, 1.0 s → 31%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "عندما يُقرأ سطر بكلمات غير موجودة في القاموس، تُنتظر قراءة أفضل مدةً أقصاها هذه القيمة. القياس في GTA V، نسبة الترجمات الناتجة عن أسطر أسيئت قراءتها مقارنةً بـ 0 ث: 0.2 ث → 77%، 0.4 ث → 49%، 0.6 ث → 41%، 0.8 ث (موصى به) → 34%، 1.0 ث → 31%."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a line is read with words that are not in the dictionary, a better reading is awaited for at most this long. Measured in GTA V, translations from misread lines compared with 0 s: 0.2 s → 77%, 0.4 s → 49%, 0.6 s → 41%, 0.8 s (recommended) → 34%, 1.0 s → 31%."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satırda sözlükte olmayan sözcükler okunursa daha iyi bir okuma için en fazla bu kadar beklenir. GTA V'te ölçülen, hatalı okumadan çıkan çeviri oranı (0 sn'ye göre): 0,2 sn → %77, 0,4 sn → %49, 0,6 sn → %41, 0,8 sn (önerilen) → %34, 1,0 sn → %31."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for a half-read line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الانتظار عند قراءة سطر ناقص"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wait for a half-read line"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yarım okunan satır için bekleme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a line looks cut off (no sentence ending, such as a mission text with a colored word), the full line is awaited for at most this long. Its effect is small: at 0 s a few more lines arrive cut off. Recommended: 0.3 s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "عندما يبدو السطر مقطوعًا (دون نهاية جملة، مثل نص مهمة فيه كلمة ملونة)، يُنتظر السطر كاملًا مدةً أقصاها هذه القيمة. تأثيره محدود: عند 0 ث تصل أسطر إضافية قليلة مقطوعة. القيمة الموصى بها: 0.3 ث."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a line looks cut off (no sentence ending, such as a mission text with a colored word), the full line is awaited for at most this long. Its effect is small: at 0 s a few more lines arrive cut off. Recommended: 0.3 s."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satır yarım görünürse (cümle sonu yoksa; ör. renkli sözcük içeren bir görev yazısı) tamamı için en fazla bu kadar beklenir. Etkisi küçüktür: 0 sn'de birkaç satır daha yarım gelir. Önerilen: 0,3 sn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
