    "If Windows asks whether Nino may use the network, allow it for private networks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا سألك Windows عن السماح لـ Nino باستخدام الشبكة، فاسمح له على الشبكات الخاصة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Windows asks whether Nino may use the network, allow it for private networks."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows, Nino'nun ağı kullanıp kullanamayacağını sorarsa özel ağlar için izin verin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't see it, make sure the Nino TV app is open and connect the TV again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا لم تظهر، فتأكد من أن تطبيق Nino للتلفاز مفتوح، ثم اتصل بالتلفاز مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you don't see it, make sure the Nino TV app is open and connect the TV again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Görmüyorsanız Nino TV uygulamasının açık olduğundan emin olun ve TV'yi yeniden bağlayın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In fixed position you can also move subtitles with the ▲ and ▼ buttons on the TV remote." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في الموضع الثابت، يمكنك أيضًا تحريك الترجمة بزرّي ▲ و ▼ في جهاز التحكم عن بُعد الخاص بالتلفاز."
          }
        },
