          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@–%@ dil paketi henüz indirilmedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcuts work only while translating, so the number keys stay free in other apps. Keep Num Lock on for the Num keys. No numeric keypad? Hold Ctrl+Shift and press the number keys above the letters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعمل الاختصارات أثناء الترجمة فقط، لتبقى مفاتيح الأرقام متاحة في التطبيقات الأخرى. أبقِ Num Lock مفعّلًا لمفاتيح Num. ليست لديك لوحة أرقام؟ اضغط مع الاستمرار على Ctrl+Shift واضغط مفاتيح الأرقام فوق الحروف."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shortcuts work only while translating, so the number keys stay free in other apps. Keep Num Lock on for the Num keys. No numeric keypad? Hold Ctrl+Shift and press the number keys above the letters."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kısayollar yalnızca çeviri açıkken çalışır; böylece sayı tuşları diğer uygulamalarda serbest kalır. Num tuşları için Num Lock açık olmalı. Sayısal tuş takımınız yok mu? Ctrl+Shift'i basılı tutup harflerin üstündeki sayı tuşlarına basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "توقفت خدمة Remote Play على PS5 بشكل غير متوقع. أعد تشغيل PS5 وأدخل رمزًا جديدًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5'in Remote Play hizmeti beklenmedik şekilde durdu. PS5'i yeniden başlatın ve yeni kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يستجب PS5. تأكد من أنه قيد التشغيل (وليس في وضع الراحة)، ومتصل بالشبكة نفسها التي يتصل بها هذا الكمبيوتر، وأن Remote Play مفعّل، ثم حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 yanıt vermedi. Açık olduğundan (dinlenme modunda olmadığından), bu bilgisayarla aynı ağda bulunduğundan ve Remote Play'in açık olduğundan emin olun, sonra tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in Nino, or sign in again with that user's account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يتعرّف PS5 على هذا الحساب. احصل على الرمز من مستخدم PS5 المسجّل بالحساب الذي استخدمته في Nino، أو سجّل الدخول مجددًا بحساب ذلك المستخدم."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in Nino, or sign in again with that user's account."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 bu hesabı tanımadı. Kodu, Nino'da kullandığınız hesapla oturum açmış PS5 kullanıcısından alın ya da o kullanıcının hesabıyla yeniden giriş yapın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 didn't accept this pairing. Pair the PS5 again with the second account in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يقبل PS5 هذا الاقتران. أعد إقران PS5 بالحساب الثاني من الإعدادات."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 didn't accept this pairing. Pair the PS5 again with the second account in Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 bu eşlemeyi kabul etmedi. Ayarlar'dan PS5'i ikinci hesapla yeniden eşleyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 refused the code. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رفض PS5 الرمز. افتح «إقران الجهاز» مجددًا على PS5 وأدخل الرمز الجديد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 refused the code. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 kodu kabul etmedi. PS5'te Cihazı Eşleştir'i yeniden açın ve yeni kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 refused the connection. Set up the PS5 again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رفض PS5 الاتصال. أعد إعداد PS5."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 refused the connection. Set up the PS5 again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 bağlantıyı reddetti. PS5'i yeniden kurun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app could not be installed. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّر تثبيت تطبيق التلفاز. حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV app could not be installed. Try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV uygulaması kurulamadı. Tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV is out of free space. Remove an app you do not use from the TV and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا توجد مساحة فارغة على التلفاز. احذف تطبيقًا لا تستخدمه من التلفاز وحاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV is out of free space. Remove an app you do not use from the TV and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'de boş alan kalmadı. Kullanmadığınız bir uygulamayı TV'den kaldırıp tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app could not be installed. Try again; if it fails again, send us the reason below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّر تثبيت تطبيق التلفاز. حاول مجددًا؛ وإن فشل مرة أخرى، أرسل إلينا السبب أدناه."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV app could not be installed. Try again; if it fails again, send us the reason below."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV uygulaması kurulamadı. Tekrar deneyin; yine olmazsa aşağıdaki nedeni bize gönderin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is not installed. Nino can install it once Developer Mode is on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تطبيق التلفاز غير مثبّت. يمكن لـ Nino تثبيته بعد تفعيل Developer Mode."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV app is not installed. Nino can install it once Developer Mode is on."
