    "Turn on the PS5. As the second user, open Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and enter the 8-digit code shown there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "شغّل PS5. بصفتك المستخدم الثاني، افتح الإعدادات › النظام › Remote Play › إقران الجهاز وأدخل الرمز المكوّن من 8 أرقام المعروض هناك."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on the PS5. As the second user, open Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and enter the 8-digit code shown there."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5'i açın. İkinci kullanıcıyla Ayarlar › Sistem › Uzaktan Oynatma › Cihazı Eşleştir'i açın ve orada görünen 8 haneli kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the TV. When you press Connect, the TV asks for permission once — accept it with the remote. If the Nino TV app is missing, this screen helps you install it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "شغّل التلفاز. عند الضغط على «اتصال»، يطلب التلفاز الإذن مرة واحدة؛ اقبله باستخدام جهاز التحكم عن بُعد. إن لم يكن تطبيق Nino للتلفاز مثبّتًا، تساعدك هذه الشاشة على تثبيته."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on the TV. When you press Connect, the TV asks for permission once — accept it with the remote. If the Nino TV app is missing, this screen helps you install it."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'yi açın. Bağlan'a bastığınızda TV bir kez izin ister; kumandayla onaylayın. Nino TV uygulaması kurulu değilse bu ekran kurmanıza yardım eder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
