      }
    },
    "Send the English subtitles read to the shared pool" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إرسال النصوص الإنجليزية المقروءة إلى المستودع المشترك"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Send the English subtitles read to the shared pool"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Okunan İngilizce altyazıları ortak havuza gönder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the game's English text is sent, anonymously. It is used to make better Turkish translations for everyone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يُرسَل سوى النصوص الإنجليزية للعبة، دون الكشف عن هويتك. وتُستخدم لإعداد ترجمات تركية أفضل للجميع."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the game's English text is sent, anonymously. It is used to make better Turkish translations for everyone."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yalnızca oyunun İngilizce metni anonim olarak gönderilir. Herkes için daha iyi Türkçe çeviriler hazırlamakta kullanılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nino sends the English subtitles it reads to a shared pool, anonymously, to make better Turkish translations for everyone. You can turn this off in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يرسل Nino النصوص الإنجليزية التي يقرؤها إلى مستودع مشترك دون الكشف عن هويتك، لإعداد ترجمات تركية أفضل للجميع. يمكنك إيقاف ذلك من الإعدادات."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nino sends the English subtitles it reads to a shared pool, anonymously, to make better Turkish translations for everyone. You can turn this off in Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nino, okuduğu İngilizce altyazıları herkes için daha iyi Türkçe çeviriler hazırlamak üzere anonim olarak ortak havuza gönderir. Bunu Ayarlar'dan kapatabilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No PS5 found. Make sure it is on and on the same network, or enter its IP address. Nino must also be allowed in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يُعثر على PS5. تأكد من أنه يعمل وعلى الشبكة نفسها، أو أدخل عنوان IP الخاص به. يجب أيضًا السماح لـ Nino في إعدادات النظام › الخصوصية والأمن › الشبكة المحلية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No PS5 found. Make sure it is on and on the same network, or enter its IP address. Nino must also be allowed in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 bulunamadı. Açık ve aynı ağda olduğundan emin olun ya da IP adresini girin. Ayrıca Sistem Ayarları › Gizlilik ve Güvenlik › Yerel Ağ'da Nino'ya izin verilmiş olmalı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to the PS5… This can take up to 30 seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جارٍ الاتصال بـ PS5… قد يستغرق ذلك حتى 30 ثانية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connecting to the PS5… This can take up to 30 seconds."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5'e bağlanılıyor… Bu 30 saniyeyi bulabilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code is wrong or has expired. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الرمز غير صحيح أو انتهت صلاحيته. افتح «إقران الجهاز» مجددًا على PS5 وأدخل الرمز الجديد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The code is wrong or has expired. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kod yanlış ya da süresi dolmuş. PS5'te Cihazı Eşleştir'i yeniden açın ve yeni kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 received the request but did not answer in time. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تلقى PS5 الطلب لكنه لم يردّ في الوقت المحدد. افتح «إقران الجهاز» مجددًا على PS5 وأدخل الرمز الجديد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 received the request but did not answer in time. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 isteği aldı ama zamanında yanıt vermedi. PS5'te Cihazı Eşleştir'i yeniden açın ve yeni kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No PS5 found at this address. Check the PS5's IP address under Settings › Network › Connection Status." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يُعثر على PS5 في هذا العنوان. تحقق من عنوان IP الخاص بـ PS5 في الإعدادات › الشبكة › حالة الاتصال."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No PS5 found at this address. Check the PS5's IP address under Settings › Network › Connection Status."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu adreste PS5 bulunamadı. PS5'in IP adresini Ayarlar › Ağ › Bağlantı Durumu'ndan kontrol edin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS blocked the connection to the local network. Turn on Nino in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network, then enter a new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حظر macOS الاتصال بالشبكة المحلية. فعّل Nino في إعدادات النظام › الخصوصية والأمن › الشبكة المحلية، ثم أدخل رمزًا جديدًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS blocked the connection to the local network. Turn on Nino in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network, then enter a new code."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS yerel ağ bağlantısını engelledi. Sistem Ayarları › Gizlilik ve Güvenlik › Yerel Ağ'da Nino'yu açın, sonra yeni kodu girin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this keeps happening, send us this file: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
