    },
    "Picture mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "وضع الصورة"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Picture mode"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Görüntü modu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inside the app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "داخل التطبيق"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inside the app"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uygulama içinde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overlay (for a black screen)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "طبقة علوية (عند ظهور شاشة سوداء)"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overlay (for a black screen)"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Katman (siyah ekran sorunu için)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the PS5 picture stays black inside the Nino TV app, choose Overlay: the TV shows the PS5 on its own HDMI input and the subtitles appear on top. If the picture never arrives, the TV app switches to Overlay by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا بقيت صورة PS5 سوداء داخل تطبيق Nino على التلفاز، فاختر الطبقة العلوية: يعرض التلفاز PS5 على مدخل HDMI الخاص به وتظهر الترجمة فوقه. وإذا لم تصل الصورة أبدًا، ينتقل تطبيق التلفاز إلى الطبقة العلوية تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the PS5 picture stays black inside the Nino TV app, choose Overlay: the TV shows the PS5 on its own HDMI input and the subtitles appear on top. If the picture never arrives, the TV app switches to Overlay by itself."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 görüntüsü Nino TV uygulamasında siyah kalıyorsa Katman'ı seçin: TV, PS5'i kendi HDMI girişinde gösterir, altyazı da üstünde görünür. Görüntü hiç gelmezse TV uygulaması kendiliğinden Katman'a geçer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the link" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "انسخ الرابط"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copy the link"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bağlantıyı Kopyala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Details:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "التفاصيل:"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Details:"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ayrıntılar:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the TV shows “Server under maintenance”, it cannot reach Samsung's servers: check the TV's internet connection and its date and time, restart the TV and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا عرض التلفاز «الخادم قيد الصيانة»، فهذا يعني أنه لا يستطيع الوصول إلى خوادم Samsung: تحقّق من اتصال التلفاز بالإنترنت ومن تاريخه ووقته، ثم أعد تشغيل التلفاز وحاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the TV shows “Server under maintenance”, it cannot reach Samsung's servers: check the TV's internet connection and its date and time, restart the TV and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'de “Sunucu bakım altında” yazıyorsa TV, Samsung'un sunucularına ulaşamıyor demektir: TV'nin internet bağlantısını, tarih ve saatini kontrol edin, TV'yi yeniden başlatın ve tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the sign-in window does not open, the browser may have blocked it as a pop-up: allow pop-ups for this page from the icon in the address bar, then press Open the page again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا لم تُفتح نافذة تسجيل الدخول، فربما حظرها المتصفح كنافذة منبثقة: اسمح بالنوافذ المنبثقة لهذه الصفحة من الأيقونة في شريط العنوان، ثم اضغط «افتح الصفحة مجددًا» مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the sign-in window does not open, the browser may have blocked it as a pop-up: allow pop-ups for this page from the icon in the address bar, then press Open the page again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Giriş penceresi açılmazsa tarayıcı onu açılır pencere olarak engellemiş olabilir: adres çubuğundaki simgeden bu sayfa için açılır pencerelere izin verin, sonra Sayfayı yeniden aç'a basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Nino TV app signed on another computer is still on the TV and could not be removed. On the TV, open Apps, select Nino, delete it and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يزال على التلفاز تطبيق Nino موقَّع على كمبيوتر آخر، وتعذّرت إزالته. على التلفاز، افتح التطبيقات، واختر Nino، واحذفه ثم حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Nino TV app signed on another computer is still on the TV and could not be removed. On the TV, open Apps, select Nino, delete it and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Başka bir bilgisayarda imzalanmış bir Nino TV uygulaması hâlâ TV'de ve kaldırılamadı. TV'de Uygulamalar'ı açın, Nino'yu seçip silin ve tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV did not accept the signing certificate. Make sure the TV is connected to the internet (it checks the certificate with Samsung) and its date and time are right (Settings › General › System Manager › Time), then try again. Nino gets a new certificate, so you sign in to Samsung once more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يقبل التلفاز شهادة التوقيع. تأكّد من أن التلفاز متصل بالإنترنت (فهو يتحقّق من الشهادة لدى Samsung) وأن تاريخه ووقته صحيحان (الإعدادات › عام › مدير النظام › الوقت)، ثم حاول مجددًا. سيحصل Nino على شهادة جديدة، لذا ستسجّل الدخول إلى Samsung مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV did not accept the signing certificate. Make sure the TV is connected to the internet (it checks the certificate with Samsung) and its date and time are right (Settings › General › System Manager › Time), then try again. Nino gets a new certificate, so you sign in to Samsung once more."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV imza sertifikasını kabul etmedi. TV'nin internete bağlı olduğundan (sertifikayı Samsung'la doğrular) ve tarih ile saatinin doğru olduğundan emin olun (Ayarlar › Genel › Sistem Yöneticisi › Saat), sonra tekrar deneyin. Nino yeni bir sertifika alacağı için Samsung hesabınızla bir kez daha giriş yaparsınız."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV's clock is behind, so the new certificate is not valid for it yet. Set the TV's date and time (Settings › General › System Manager › Time) or wait a few minutes, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ساعة التلفاز متأخرة، لذا لم تصبح الشهادة الجديدة صالحة له بعد. اضبط تاريخ التلفاز ووقته (الإعدادات › عام › مدير النظام › الوقت) أو انتظر بضع دقائق، ثم حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV's clock is behind, so the new certificate is not valid for it yet. Set the TV's date and time (Settings › General › System Manager › Time) or wait a few minutes, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'nin saati geride olduğu için yeni sertifika TV'ye göre henüz geçerli değil. TV'nin tarih ve saatini düzeltin (Ayarlar › Genel › Sistem Yöneticisi › Saat) ya da birkaç dakika bekleyin, sonra tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV refuses Nino because an earlier Nino is still registered on it (Tizen error 118, -22), even if it no longer appears among the apps. If Nino is among the TV's apps, delete it there and try again. Otherwise reset Smart Hub (Settings › Support › Device Care › Self Diagnosis › Reset Smart Hub; menu names differ a little by model) and try again. Resetting Smart Hub also removes the other apps you downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يرفض التلفاز Nino لأن نسخة سابقة من Nino لا تزال مسجّلة عليه (خطأ Tizen 118، -22)، حتى إن لم تعد تظهر بين التطبيقات. إذا كان Nino بين تطبيقات التلفاز، فاحذفه من هناك وحاول مجددًا. وإلا فأعد ضبط Smart Hub (الإعدادات › الدعم › العناية بالجهاز › التشخيص الذاتي › إعادة ضبط Smart Hub؛ تختلف أسماء القوائم قليلًا حسب الطراز) ثم حاول مجددًا. تؤدي إعادة ضبط Smart Hub أيضًا إلى إزالة التطبيقات الأخرى التي نزّلتها."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV refuses Nino because an earlier Nino is still registered on it (Tizen error 118, -22), even if it no longer appears among the apps. If Nino is among the TV's apps, delete it there and try again. Otherwise reset Smart Hub (Settings › Support › Device Care › Self Diagnosis › Reset Smart Hub; menu names differ a little by model) and try again. Resetting Smart Hub also removes the other apps you downloaded."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV, Nino'yu kabul etmiyor çünkü önceki bir Nino hâlâ TV'de kayıtlı (Tizen hatası 118, -22); uygulamalar arasında görünmese bile. Nino TV'nin uygulamaları arasındaysa oradan silin ve tekrar deneyin. Değilse Smart Hub'ı sıfırlayın (Ayarlar › Destek › Cihaz Bakımı › Kendi Kendine Tanılama › Smart Hub'ı Sıfırla; menü adları modele göre biraz değişir) ve tekrar deneyin. Smart Hub'ı sıfırlamak, indirdiğiniz diğer uygulamaları da kaldırır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the TV dropped during the install. Keep the TV on and on the same network as this computer, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "انقطع الاتصال بالتلفاز أثناء التثبيت. أبقِ التلفاز يعمل وعلى الشبكة نفسها التي يتصل بها هذا الكمبيوتر، ثم حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connection to the TV dropped during the install. Keep the TV on and on the same network as this computer, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kurulum sırasında TV bağlantısı koptu. TV'yi açık ve bu bilgisayarla aynı ağda tutun, sonra tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the TV, open Apps and scroll to the very bottom of the page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. على التلفاز، افتح التطبيقات ومرّر إلى أسفل الصفحة تمامًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. On the TV, open Apps and scroll to the very bottom of the page."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. TV'de Uygulamalar'ı açın ve sayfanın en altına inin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. There, press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. هناك، اضغط 1 2 3 4 5 على جهاز التحكم عن بُعد (أو اكتب 12345 على لوحة الأرقام الظاهرة على الشاشة). ستُفتح نافذة وضع المطوّر."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. There, press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Orada kumandada 1 2 3 4 5 tuşlarına basın (ya da ekran klavyesinde 12345 yazın). Geliştirici modu penceresi açılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Samsung account page opened in your browser. Finish signing in there. If you do not see it, switch to the browser or press Open the page again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فُتحت صفحة حساب Samsung في متصفحك. أكمل تسجيل الدخول هناك. إذا لم ترها، فانتقل إلى المتصفح أو اضغط «افتح الصفحة مجددًا» مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Samsung account page opened in your browser. Finish signing in there. If you do not see it, switch to the browser or press Open the page again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Samsung hesap sayfası tarayıcınızda açıldı; girişi orada tamamlayın. Göremiyorsanız tarayıcıya geçin ya da Sayfayı yeniden aç'a basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Samsung signs the app for your TV with your free Samsung account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "توقّع Samsung التطبيق لتلفازك باستخدام حساب Samsung المجاني الخاص بك."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Samsung signs the app for your TV with your free Samsung account."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Samsung, uygulamayı ücretsiz Samsung hesabınızla TV'nize özel imzalar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accept the permission box on the TV with the remote (Allow). Nino waits 60 seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اقبل نافذة الإذن على التلفاز باستخدام جهاز التحكم عن بُعد (السماح). سينتظر Nino مدة 60 ثانية."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accept the permission box on the TV with the remote (Allow). Nino waits 60 seconds."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'de çıkan izin kutusunu kumandayla onaylayın (İzin ver). Nino 60 saniye bekler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV's permission box was not accepted within 60 seconds. If no box appeared, open the TV's home screen and press Connect again. If Nino was denied before, allow it in Settings › General › External Device Manager › Device Connection Manager › Device List." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم تُقبَل نافذة الإذن على التلفاز خلال 60 ثانية. إذا لم تظهر أي نافذة، فافتح الشاشة الرئيسية للتلفاز واضغط «اتصال» مجددًا. وإذا سبق رفض Nino، فاسمح به من الإعدادات › عام › مدير الأجهزة الخارجية › مدير اتصال الأجهزة › قائمة الأجهزة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV's permission box was not accepted within 60 seconds. If no box appeared, open the TV's home screen and press Connect again. If Nino was denied before, allow it in Settings › General › External Device Manager › Device Connection Manager › Device List."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV'deki izin kutusu 60 saniye içinde onaylanmadı. Kutu hiç çıkmadıysa TV'nin ana ekranını açın ve yeniden Bağlan'a basın. Nino'yu daha önce reddettiyseniz Ayarlar › Genel › Harici Aygıt Yöneticisi › Cihaz Bağlantı Yöneticisi › Cihaz Listesi'nden izin verin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV refused the connection. Allow Nino in Settings › General › External Device Manager › Device Connection Manager › Device List on the TV, then press Connect again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رفض التلفاز الاتصال. اسمح بـ Nino من الإعدادات › عام › مدير الأجهزة الخارجية › مدير اتصال الأجهزة › قائمة الأجهزة على التلفاز، ثم اضغط «اتصال» مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV refused the connection. Allow Nino in Settings › General › External Device Manager › Device Connection Manager › Device List on the TV, then press Connect again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV bağlantıyı reddetti. TV'de Ayarlar › Genel › Harici Aygıt Yöneticisi › Cihaz Bağlantı Yöneticisi › Cihaz Listesi'nden Nino'ya izin verin, sonra yeniden Bağlan'a basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
