    },
    "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same Wi-Fi as this phone, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يستجب PS5. تأكّد من أنه يعمل (وليس في وضع الراحة)، وأنه على شبكة Wi-Fi نفسها التي يتصل بها هذا الهاتف، وأن Remote Play مفعّل، ثم حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same Wi-Fi as this phone, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 yanıt vermedi. Açık olduğundan (dinlenme modunda olmadığından), bu telefonla aynı Wi-Fi ağında bulunduğundan ve Remote Play'in açık olduğundan emin olun, sonra tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS blocked the connection to the home network. Turn on Nino in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network, then enter a new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حظر iOS الاتصال بالشبكة المنزلية. فعّل Nino من الإعدادات › الخصوصية والأمن › الشبكة المحلية، ثم أدخل رمزًا جديدًا."
          }
        },
