        }
      }
    },
    "Remote Play with your own account would take over your controller and stop your game. With a second, free account the PS5 lets the phone watch the picture while you keep playing on the TV. Create it on the PS5 (Add User) or at playstation.com." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا استخدمت Remote Play بحسابك الخاص، فسيستولي على يد التحكم ويوقف لعبتك. أما مع حساب ثانٍ مجاني، فيسمح PS5 للهاتف بمشاهدة الصورة بينما تواصل اللعب على التلفاز. أنشئه على PS5 (إضافة مستخدم) أو على playstation.com."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remote Play with your own account would take over your controller and stop your game. With a second, free account the PS5 lets the phone watch the picture while you keep playing on the TV. Create it on the PS5 (Add User) or at playstation.com."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kendi hesabınızla Remote Play, joystick'inizin kontrolünü alır ve oyununuzu durdurur. Ücretsiz ikinci bir hesapla PS5, siz TV'de oynamaya devam ederken telefonunuzun görüntüyü izlemesine izin verir. Hesabı PS5'te (Kullanıcı Ekle) ya da playstation.com'da açabilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair the PS5" : {
