    "Make sure the PS5 is on (not in rest mode) and on the same Wi-Fi, and that Nino is allowed in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network. You can also type the PS5's IP address (PS5: Settings › Network › Connection Status)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تأكّد من أن PS5 يعمل (وليس في وضع الراحة) وعلى شبكة Wi-Fi نفسها، وأن Nino مسموح به في الإعدادات › الخصوصية والأمن › الشبكة المحلية. يمكنك أيضًا كتابة عنوان IP لجهاز PS5 (على PS5: الإعدادات › الشبكة › حالة الاتصال)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make sure the PS5 is on (not in rest mode) and on the same Wi-Fi, and that Nino is allowed in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network. You can also type the PS5's IP address (PS5: Settings › Network › Connection Status)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5'in açık (dinlenme modunda değil) ve aynı Wi-Fi'da olduğundan, Nino'ya Ayarlar › Gizlilik ve Güvenlik › Yerel Ağ'dan izin verildiğinden emin olun. PS5'in IP adresini de yazabilirsiniz (PS5: Ayarlar › Ağ › Bağlantı Durumu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
