            "value" : "Yerel model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local model (Ollama, LM Studio)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نموذج محلي (Ollama، LM Studio)"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Local model (Ollama, LM Studio)"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yerel model (Ollama, LM Studio)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free, with no quota. An AI model on this computer (Ollama or LM Studio) translates; subtitle text never leaves it. Speed depends on your computer. When the model cannot be reached, the free translation takes over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مجاني وبلا حدود. يترجم نموذج ذكاء اصطناعي على هذا الكمبيوتر (Ollama أو LM Studio)؛ ولا تغادر النصوص جهازك أبدًا. تعتمد السرعة على جهازك. إذا تعذّر الوصول إلى النموذج، تتولى الترجمة المجانية المهمة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free, with no quota. An AI model on this computer (Ollama or LM Studio) translates; subtitle text never leaves it. Speed depends on your computer. When the model cannot be reached, the free translation takes over."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ücretsiz ve kotasız. Bu bilgisayardaki bir yapay zekâ modeli (Ollama ya da LM Studio) çevirir; çeviri için altyazı metni bilgisayardan çıkmaz. Hız bilgisayarınıza bağlıdır. Modele ulaşılamazsa ücretsiz çeviri devreye girer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local model server did not accept the API key. Check the key, or remove it if the server does not need one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يقبل خادم النموذج المحلي مفتاح API. تحقق من المفتاح، أو احذفه إذا كان الخادم لا يحتاج إليه."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The local model server did not accept the API key. Check the key, or remove it if the server does not need one."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yerel model sunucusu API anahtarını kabul etmedi. Anahtarı kontrol edin; sunucu anahtar istemiyorsa kaldırın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local model server is busy. Try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "خادم النموذج المحلي مشغول. حاول مرة أخرى بعد قليل."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The local model server is busy. Try again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yerel model sunucusu meşgul. Birazdan tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LM Studio does not have the model %@. Download and load it in LM Studio, or check the model name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "النموذج %@ غير موجود في LM Studio. نزّله وحمّله في LM Studio، أو تحقق من اسم النموذج."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
