    "Type the model name as the server shows it. In Ollama, download it first: ollama pull translategemma:4b (with 16 GB of memory or more, translategemma:12b translates better). MiLMMT from Xiaomi also translates well: ollama pull hf.co/mradermacher/MiLMMT-46-4B-v1.0-GGUF:Q4_K_M. Downloaded models: ollama list. In LM Studio, load the model and start the local server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اكتب اسم النموذج كما يعرضه الخادم. في Ollama، نزّله أولًا: ollama pull translategemma:4b (مع ذاكرة 16 GB أو أكثر، يترجم translategemma:12b بشكل أفضل). نموذج MiLMMT من Xiaomi يترجم جيدًا أيضًا: ollama pull hf.co/mradermacher/MiLMMT-46-4B-v1.0-GGUF:Q4_K_M. النماذج المنزّلة: ollama list. في LM Studio، حمّل النموذج وشغّل الخادم المحلي."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Type the model name as the server shows it. In Ollama, download it first: ollama pull translategemma:4b (with 16 GB of memory or more, translategemma:12b translates better). MiLMMT from Xiaomi also translates well: ollama pull hf.co/mradermacher/MiLMMT-46-4B-v1.0-GGUF:Q4_K_M. Downloaded models: ollama list. In LM Studio, load the model and start the local server."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model adını sunucunun gösterdiği gibi yazın. Ollama'da önce modeli indirin: ollama pull translategemma:4b (16 GB ya da daha çok belleğiniz varsa translategemma:12b daha iyi çevirir). Xiaomi'nin MiLMMT modeli de iyi çevirir: ollama pull hf.co/mradermacher/MiLMMT-46-4B-v1.0-GGUF:Q4_K_M. İndirilen modeller: ollama list. LM Studio'da modeli yükleyin ve yerel sunucuyu başlatın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
