            "value" : "Sistem sağlığı"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not accept this Mac. Pair the PS5 again from Settings › About Nino › Set up again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يقبل PS5 جهاز Mac هذا. أقرِن PS5 من جديد من الإعدادات › حول Nino › الإعداد من جديد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not accept this Mac. Pair the PS5 again from Settings › About Nino › Set up again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 bu Mac'i kabul etmedi. PS5'i Ayarlar › Nino Hakkında › Yeniden kur'dan yeniden eşleyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 is off or asleep. Turn it on, or turn on “Stay connected to the internet” in its rest mode settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 مطفأ أو في وضع الراحة. شغّله، أو فعّل «البقاء متصلًا بالإنترنت» في إعدادات وضع الراحة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 is off or asleep. Turn it on, or turn on “Stay connected to the internet” in its rest mode settings."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 kapalı ya da dinlenme modunda. Açın ya da dinlenme modu ayarlarında “İnternete bağlı kal”ı açın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 picture is losing data. Connect this Mac to the modem with a cable (a USB-C Ethernet adapter works). If that is not possible, move closer to the modem and use 5 GHz Wi-Fi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تفقد صورة PS5 بعض البيانات. وصّل جهاز Mac هذا بالمودم بكابل (يصلح محوّل USB-C إلى Ethernet). إن لم يكن ذلك ممكنًا، فاقترب من المودم واستخدم Wi-Fi بتردد 5 GHz."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 picture is losing data. Connect this Mac to the modem with a cable (a USB-C Ethernet adapter works). If that is not possible, move closer to the modem and use 5 GHz Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 görüntüsü veri kaybediyor. Bu Mac'i modeme kabloyla bağlayın (USB-C Ethernet adaptörü olur). Olmuyorsa modeme yaklaşın ve 5 GHz Wi-Fi kullanın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is not connected. Open the Nino app on the TV and check that the TV is on the same network as this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تطبيق التلفاز غير متصل. افتح تطبيق Nino على التلفاز وتحقق من أن التلفاز على الشبكة نفسها التي عليها جهاز Mac هذا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The TV app is not connected. Open the Nino app on the TV and check that the TV is on the same network as this Mac."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV uygulaması bağlı değil. TV'de Nino uygulamasını açın ve TV'nin bu Mac'le aynı ağda olduğunu kontrol edin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the PS5 keeps dropping. Connect both the PS5 and this Mac to the modem with a cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
