            "value" : "Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If something does not work, send the zip to whoever helps you. The logs contain the subtitles Nino read, the PS5's name and its address on your home network, but no password, key or account information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا لم يعمل شيء ما، فأرسل ملف zip إلى من يساعدك. تحتوي السجلات على النصوص التي قرأها Nino واسم PS5 وعنوانه على شبكتك المنزلية، ولا تحتوي على أي كلمة مرور أو مفتاح أو معلومات حساب."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If something does not work, send the zip to whoever helps you. The logs contain the subtitles Nino read, the PS5's name and its address on your home network, but no password, key or account information."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bir şey çalışmazsa bu zip dosyasını size yardım eden kişiye gönderin. Kayıtlarda Nino'nun okuduğu altyazılar, PS5'in adı ve ev ağındaki adresi var; parola, anahtar ya da hesap bilgisi yok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is not connected to a network. Connect it to the same modem as the PS5." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جهاز Mac هذا غير متصل بأي شبكة. وصّله بالمودم نفسه المتصل به PS5."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac is not connected to a network. Connect it to the same modem as the PS5."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu Mac bir ağa bağlı değil. PS5'le aynı modeme bağlayın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not answer on the network. Check that it is on (or in rest mode) and on the same network as this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يستجب PS5 على الشبكة. تحقق من أنه يعمل (أو في وضع الراحة) وأنه على الشبكة نفسها التي عليها جهاز Mac هذا."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not answer on the network. Check that it is on (or in rest mode) and on the same network as this Mac."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS5 ağda yanıt vermedi. Açık (ya da dinlenme modunda) ve bu Mac'le aynı ağda olduğunu kontrol edin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation is slow. Close other heavy apps on this Mac and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الترجمة بطيئة. أغلق التطبيقات الثقيلة الأخرى على جهاز Mac هذا وحاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
