            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نافذة Remote Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play in PS Remote Play or chiaki-ng on this computer. Nino reads that window and shows the translation on top of the game. No second account needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oyunu bu bilgisayarda PS Remote Play ya da chiaki-ng ile oyna. Nino o pencereyi okur ve çeviriyi oyunun üstünde gösterir. İkinci hesaba gerek yok."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "العب عبر PS Remote Play أو chiaki-ng على هذا الحاسوب. يقرأ Nino تلك النافذة ويعرض الترجمة فوق اللعبة، دون الحاجة إلى حساب ثانٍ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oyun penceresi"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نافذة اللعبة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the PS Remote Play window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS Remote Play penceresini okur"
          }
