          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يقرأ نافذة PS Remote Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Nino in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen Recording, then reopen Nino." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sistem Ayarları › Gizlilik ve Güvenlik › Ekran Kaydı'nda Nino'ya izin ver, sonra Nino'yu yeniden aç."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اسمح لـ Nino من إعدادات النظام › الخصوصية والأمان › تسجيل الشاشة، ثم أعد فتح Nino."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open PS Remote Play or chiaki-ng and start playing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PS Remote Play'i ya da chiaki-ng'yi aç ve oynamaya başla"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "افتح PS Remote Play أو chiaki-ng وابدأ اللعب"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ okunuyor"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جارٍ قراءة %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I play on this computer with PS Remote Play" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bilgisayarda PS Remote Play ile oynuyorum"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ألعب على هذا الحاسوب عبر PS Remote Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No TV or second account needed. Nino reads the Remote Play window and shows the translation on top of the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV ya da ikinci hesap gerekmez. Nino Remote Play penceresini okur ve çeviriyi oyunun üstünde gösterir."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا حاجة إلى تلفاز أو حساب ثانٍ. يقرأ Nino نافذة Remote Play ويعرض الترجمة فوق اللعبة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nino reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows an Arabic translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nino, PS5 oyunlarının İngilizce altyazılarını okur ve Arapça çevirisini TV'de oyunun üstünde gösterir. Siz de TV'de kendi joystick'inizle oynamaya devam edersiniz."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يقرأ Nino النصوص الإنجليزية في ألعاب PS5 ويعرض ترجمتها العربية على التلفاز فوق اللعبة، وتواصل اللعب على التلفاز بيد التحكم الخاصة بك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture card" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Capture Card"
          }
        },
